parsed.grading_scheme:
(a) 2 points: {1 point: two terms; 1 point: remaining terms}

(b) 2 points: {1 point: three terms for $e^x$; 1 point: three terms for $e^x f(x)$}

(c) 2 points: {1 point: antiderivative; 1 point: answer}

(d) 3 points: {1 point: uses fourth-degree term of Maclaurin series for $f$; 1 point: uses first omitted term of series for $h(1)$; 1 point: error bound}
